Verification of L1SUBPOOL Stream PRB Capacity within PRB Pooling Report
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the arguments ${stream_prb_capa} ${alloc_stream_prb} ${subpool_id}
    ...     Actions:        it verifies all the l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity and numAllocStreamPRB values of the recommended sub pool id
    ...     Checks:         it checks the values within PRB Pooling Allocation SubPool Report
    ...     Verdict:        l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity and numAllocStreamPRB values are as expected
    [Arguments]             ${stream_prb_capa}
    ...                     ${subpool_id}=0

    ${file_path_report}     Set Variable        Dl_PrbPoolingAllocationSubpool_45_.csv
    # l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity
    Dated Log New Line      Check if ${COL_NAME_L1SUBPOOLSTREAMPRBCAPACITY}>=${stream_prb_capa} for ${COL_NAME_SUBPOOLID}=${subpool_id}
    Dated Log               ${file_path_report}
    ${L1Sp_Stream_Prb_capacity_result}          Sherpa.Verify value with operator in csv Files with Prerequisite
    ...                                                    CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                                    Column_name=${COL_NAME_L1SUBPOOLSTREAMPRBCAPACITY}
    ...                                                    valuetocheck=${stream_prb_capa}
    ...                                                    check_operator=>
    ...                                                    directory=${sherpa_output_path}
    ...                                                    colum_prereq=${COL_NAME_SUBPOOLID}
    ...                                                    regex_prereq=${subpool_id}
    Run Keyword If    ${L1Sp_Stream_Prb_capacity_result} == True
    ...               Dated Log    DL L1 SubPool stream PRB capacity is equal to ${stream_prb_capa} for ${COL_NAME_SUBPOOLID}=${subpool_id}
    ...    ELSE       Dated Log    DL L1 SubPool stream PRB capacity IS NOT EQUAL TO ${stream_prb_capa} for ${COL_NAME_SUBPOOLID}=${subpool_id}
    should be true    ${verif_result} == True
    # numAllocStreamPRB

Verify PRB Allocated is within a range of min and max values
    [Documentation]
    [Arguments]             ${nrCell_id}
    ...                     ${direction}
    ...                     ${min_prb_value}
    ...                     ${max_prb_value}
    ...                     ${result_req}=True
    ${sherpa_file_name}     Set Variable        PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    ${file_path_report}=    Catenate    ${direction}_${sherpa_file_name}
    Dated Log   ${file_path_report}
    Dated Log New Line      ${file_path_report}
    Dated Log New Line      Verify the number of PRB allocated ${direction} by BBRM to NRCELLID=${nrCell_id}
    ${min_result}           Verify value with operator in csv Files with Prerequisite
    ...                                         CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                         ColumnName=${COL_NAME_NUMPRBALLOC}
    ...                                         valuetocheck=${min_prb_value}
    ...                                         check_operator=<=
    ...                                         directory=${sherpa_output_path}
    ...                                         colum_prereq=${COL_NAME_NRCELLID}
    ...                                         regex_prereq=${nrCell_id}
    ${max_result}           Verify value with operator in csv Files with Prerequisite
    ...                                         CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                         ColumnName=${COL_NAME_NUMPRBALLOC}
    ...                                         valuetocheck=${max_prb_value}
    ...                                         check_operator=>=
    ...                                         directory=${sherpa_output_path}
    ...                                         colum_prereq=${COL_NAME_NRCELLID}
    ...                                         regex_prereq=${nrCell_id}
    Run Keyword If          ${min_result} == True and ${max_result} == True
    ...    Dated Log New Line    PRB Allocated to the NRCell:${nrCell_id} in ${direction} is between:${min_prb_value} & ${max_prb_value}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log New Line    PRB Allocated to the NRCell:${nrCell_id} in ${direction} is outside range:${min_prb_value} & ${max_prb_value}
    should be true          ${min_result} == ${result_req}
    should be true          ${max_result} == ${result_req}

Verify NumMinPrbAlloc and NumMaxPrbAlloc values
    [Documentation]
    [Arguments]             ${nrCell_id}
    ...                     ${direction}
    ...                     ${NumMinPrbAlloc_value}
    ...                     ${NumMaxPrbAlloc_value}
    ...                     ${result_req}=True
    ${sherpa_file_name}     Set Variable        PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    ${file_path_report}=    Catenate    ${direction}_${sherpa_file_name}
    Dated Log New Line      Verify the NumMaxPrbAlloc in ${direction} by BBRM to NRCELLID=${nrCell_id}
    ${min_result}           Verify value with operator in csv Files with Prerequisite
    ...                                         CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                         ColumnName=${COL_NAME_NumMinPrbAlloc}
    ...                                         valuetocheck=${NumMinPrbAlloc_value}
    ...                                         check_operator=<=
    ...                                         directory=${sherpa_output_path}
    ...                                         colum_prereq=${COL_NAME_NRCELLID}
    ...                                         regex_prereq=${nrCell_id}
    ${max_result}           Verify value with operator in csv Files with Prerequisite
    ...                                         CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                         ColumnName=${COL_NAME_NumMaxPrbAlloc}
    ...                                         valuetocheck=${NumMaxPrbAlloc_value}
    ...                                         check_operator=>=
    ...                                         directory=${sherpa_output_path}
    ...                                         colum_prereq=${COL_NAME_NRCELLID}
    ...                                         regex_prereq=${nrCell_id}
    Run Keyword If          ${min_result} == True
    ...    Dated Log New Line    NumMinPrbAllocated to the NRCell:${nrCell_id} in ${direction} is equal to : ${NumMinPrbAlloc_value}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log New Line    NumMinPrbAlloc to the NRCell:${nrCell_id} in ${direction} is not equal : ${NumMinPrbAlloc_value}
    Run Keyword If          ${max_result} == True
    ...    Dated Log New Line    NumMaxPrbAllocated to the NRCell:${nrCell_id} in ${direction} is equal to : ${NumMaxPrbAlloc_value}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log New Line    NumMaxPrbAllocated to the NRCell:${nrCell_id} in ${direction} is equal to :${NumMaxPrbAlloc_value}
    should be true          ${min_result} == ${result_req}
    should be true          ${max_result} == ${result_req}


TTI Trace Collection
    ${TTIdir}               Get TTI Trace Path                      dir_suffix=CB010513-EnhancedPRBPooling
    Dated Log New Line      Start TTI traces capture
    Start TTI Traces in Streaming mode    src_ip=10.0.1.2
    Traced Sleep            2 seconds    msg=TTI capture
    ${TTIpcap}              Stop TTI Traces in Streaming mode       tti_trace_path=${TTIdir}
    ...                                                             tti_trace_filename=TTiTrace_CB010513
    Dated Log New Line      Convert TTItrace to json and csv
    ${TTIjson}              Convert TTItrace from pcap to others    input_file_path=${TTIpcap}
    ${TTIcsv}               ttitrace_tools.decode_tti_traces_json_using_TtitraceReaderEvtDec    jsonPathName=${TTIjson}
    ...                           num_of_events=10000
    set Suite Variable     ${TTIjson}

End Of TC Teardown
   [Documentation]        At the end of each TC :
   ...                      - show the Diagnosis of the TC steps
   ...                      - collect the gnb Snapshot
   ...                      - if TC failed, collect also AP sosReport

   Dated Log              End Of TC : start
   Produce Scout Data
   Oam.OAM Get Snapshot
   Run Keyword If Test Failed     Setup.Get Sos Report
   GenericTest.Display Diagnosis
   Dated Log              End of TC : end
